# Risk Scoring Rubric

Use this rubric to classify Morpheus-enabled work before promotion.

| Tier | Description | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Internal experimental | Local productivity workflows |
| 2 | Internal production | Team automation with human review |
| 3 | Customer-facing | User-impacting agentic workflows |
| 4 | Regulated/high-impact | PHI/PII, financial, safety, or compliance-sensitive workflows |
